				339,
				36
			],
			"Message": "build(Common): Add TypeScript declaration files for Workers Cloudflare API\n\nGenerate .d.ts declaration files and source maps for Workers Cloudflare function interfaces in the Common library. The declarations cover:\n\n- Function modules: Access, Decrypt, Encrypt, Get, Put, Redirect, Response, Uint8ArrayFromObject\n- Interface modules: Access, Data, Decrypt, Encrypt, Get, Object, Put, Redirect, Response, Uint8ArrayFromObject\n\nThese types provide TypeScript type definitions for the Cloudflare Workers KV storage, encryption, and HTTP response handling functions, enabling type-safe usage of these APIs throughout the Land project.",
